.TH DEEPFINDER 1 "October 2025" "0.1.2" "deepfinder manual"
.SH NAME
deepfinder \- Find duplicate files by name or file content
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deepfinder
<path> [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B deepfinder
is a command-line utility used to detect duplicate files within a given directory. It can identify duplicates either by their filenames or by computing and comparing content hashes. It also supports exporting results in multiple formats including CSV, JSON, and XML.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -n ", " --name
Find duplicates by their filename.  
Selected by default if neither \fB-n\fR nor \fB-a\fR is specified.

.TP
.BR -a ", " --hash-algorithm
Find duplicates by file content using a hash algorithm.  
Supported algorithms:  
\fImd5, sha1, sha224, sha256, sha384, sha512,\fR  
\fIsha3-224, sha3-256, sha3-384, sha3-512,\fR  
\fIblake2b-512, blake2s-256, whirlpool\fR.

.TP
.BR -f ", " --hidden-files
Include hidden files in the search.

.TP
.BR -c " <path>, " --csv-display
Output the results in CSV format to standard output.

.TP
.BR -C " <path>, " --csv-output " <path>"
Export the results to a CSV file.

.TP
.BR -j " <path>, " --json-display
Output the results in JSON format to standard output.

.TP
.BR -J " <path>, " --json-output " <path>"
Export the results to a JSON file.

.TP
.BR -x " <path>, " --xml-display
Output the results in XML format to standard output.

.TP
.BR -X " <path>, " --xml-output " <path>"
Export the results to an XML file.

.TP
.BR -i ", " --include-hashes
Include the checksums of the duplicates in the output. This argument requires -a to be specified.

.TP
.BR -v ", " --version
Display the version of \fBdeepfinder\fR.

.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Display this help message.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Find duplicates by name:
.B deepfinder /home/user/Documents

.TP
Find duplicates by content using SHA-256:
.B deepfinder /home/user/Documents -a sha256

.TP
Export results to JSON on stdout:
.B deepfinder /data -j

.TP
Export results to a CSV file:
.B deepfinder /data -C results.csv

